The `lifeline` generated scene contains code derived from Lifeline
(https://github.com/evilrabbit/lifeline), which is distributed under the MIT
License. visuals/src/lifeline/intro-timing.ts is copied substantially verbatim
from components/lifeline/lifeline-intro-timing.ts (with helpers inlined from
lifeline-utils.ts and use-lifeline-intro.ts); the keyframes block at the top of
visuals/src/lifeline/lifeline.css is copied from app/globals.css; parts of
visuals/src/lifeline/lifeline.ts (the marker width heuristic and the intro
sweep loop) are adapted from lifeline-utils.ts and use-lifeline-scroll.ts. The
committed bundle visuals/primitives/lifeline.js contains these portions.

